<title>USA: Intelligroup files for share offering.</title>
<headline>Intelligroup files for share offering.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intelligroup Inc said on Thursday it had filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 1.8 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Of this, 900,000 shares are to be issued and sold by the company, and 900,000 shares are to be sold by certain shareholders, the company said.</p>
<p>The offering is being managed by Cowen &amp; Co and Montgomery Securities.</p>
